rationale:
  overview: |
    Notion presents itself as the all-in-one workspace through a confident, illustration-rich brand voice. The homepage opens with **"Meet the night shift."** rendered centered over a deep navy hero band ({tokens.color.brand-navy}), decorated with brand-colored sticky-note dots and mesh wire illustrations scattered around the headline. The signature **purple pill primary CTA** ({tokens.color.primary}) "Get Notion free" sits at the visual center, paired with an outlined "Request a demo" secondary. Below the buttons, a real Notion workspace UI mockup card (the "Ramp HQ" kanban board) breaks out of the hero band with a deep diffuse drop shadow.
    
    Below the hero, the page cycles through a distinctive sequence of feature sections: a dense sticky-note "Keep work moving 24/7" panel with red/blue/green/purple/teal status icons; a **bold yellow** ({tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}) "Ask your on-demand assistants" banner card flanked by orange/rose/mint pastel feature tiles showing assistant UI mockups; and a "Bring all your work together" 3-column grid with brand-colored mockups (sky-blue tutorial card, light Notion calendar, brown/rust testimonial slate). The pricing page renders 4 tiers (Free / Plus / Business / Enterprise) horizontally with one tier featured (purple-bordered) and a dense feature comparison table running below.
    
    The system uses a Notion-Sans typeface (Inter-based) across every UI surface — humanist-geometric character that pairs naturally with the colorful illustrations. Buttons are `{tokens.radius.md}` (8px) rectangles, NOT pills — distinguishing Notion's sober rectangular geometry from competitors that use pills universally. Cards use `{tokens.radius.lg}` (12px) consistently.
    
    **Key Characteristics:**
    - Deep navy hero band ({tokens.color.brand-navy}) with scattered sticky-note dots + mesh wire decorative illustrations
    - **Signature purple pill** ({tokens.color.primary}) primary CTA — Notion's recognizable "Get Notion free" button color
    - Real Notion workspace UI mockup card embedded in the hero with deep drop shadow
    - Bold yellow feature banner ({tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}) for high-emphasis content sections
    - Pastel feature card palette (peach, rose, mint, lavender, sky, yellow) echoing the live product database properties
    - Notion-Sans (Inter-based) across every UI surface
    - 8px-rounded buttons (NOT pills), 12px-rounded cards — sober editorial geometry
    - 4-tier pricing comparison with dense feature table
    - Centered hero layout (different from the left-aligned norm of most B2B SaaS)
  colors: |
    > Source pages: notion.com/ (homepage), /enterprise, /product/ai, /product/agents, /startups, /pricing. Token coverage was identical across all six pages.
    
    ### Brand & Primary
    - **Notion Purple** ({tokens.color.primary}): Signature primary CTA color — the unmistakable "Get Notion free" pill button. Reserved for the dominant CTA only.
    - **Purple Pressed** ({tokens.color.primary-pressed}): Pressed-state variant
    - **Purple Deep** ({tokens.color.primary-deep}): Deeper variant for emphasis
    - **Brand Navy** ({tokens.color.brand-navy}): Hero band background — deep navy
    - **Brand Navy Deep** ({tokens.color.brand-navy-deep}): Deeper navy for promo banner
    - **Brand Navy Mid** ({tokens.color.brand-navy-mid}): Mid-spectrum navy
    - **Link Blue** ({tokens.color.link-blue}): Inline text link blue (NOT primary CTA)
    - **Link Blue Pressed** ({tokens.color.link-blue-pressed}): Pressed-state link blue
    
    ### Brand Color Spectrum (echoes live product database properties)
    - **Brand Pink** ({tokens.color.brand-pink}): Pink accent
    - **Brand Pink Deep** ({tokens.color.brand-pink-deep}): Deeper pink
    - **Brand Orange** ({tokens.color.brand-orange}): Orange accent
    - **Brand Orange Deep** ({tokens.color.brand-orange-deep}): Deeper orange-rust
    - **Brand Purple** ({tokens.color.brand-purple}): Purple accent variant
    - **Brand Purple 300** ({tokens.color.brand-purple-300}): Light purple
    - **Brand Purple 800** ({tokens.color.brand-purple-800}): Deep purple for tag text
    - **Brand Teal** ({tokens.color.brand-teal}): Teal accent
    - **Brand Green** ({tokens.color.brand-green}): Bright green
    - **Brand Yellow** ({tokens.color.brand-yellow}): Soft yellow
    - **Brand Brown** ({tokens.color.brand-brown}): Brand brown for "earthy" tints
    
    ### Card Tints (Pastel Feature Card Backgrounds)
    - **Tint Peach** ({tokens.color.card-tint-peach}): Pale peach
    - **Tint Rose** ({tokens.color.card-tint-rose}): Pale rose-pink
    - **Tint Mint** ({tokens.color.card-tint-mint}): Pale mint-green
    - **Tint Lavender** ({tokens.color.card-tint-lavender}): Pale lavender
    - **Tint Sky** ({tokens.color.card-tint-sky}): Pale sky-blue
    - **Tint Yellow** ({tokens.color.card-tint-yellow}): Pale yellow
    - **Tint Yellow Bold** ({tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}): Bold yellow for high-emphasis feature banners ("Ask your on-demand assistants")
    - **Tint Cream** ({tokens.color.card-tint-cream}): Cream tint
    - **Tint Gray** ({tokens.color.card-tint-gray}): Neutral surface
    
    ### Surface
    - **Canvas White** ({tokens.color.canvas}): Page background and primary card surface
    - **Surface** ({tokens.color.surface}): Subtle section backgrounds, search-pill rest, featured pricing tier
    - **Surface Soft** ({tokens.color.surface-soft}): Quieter section divisions
    - **Hairline** ({tokens.color.hairline}): 1px borders and primary dividers
    - **Hairline Soft** ({tokens.color.hairline-soft}): Quieter dividers
    - **Hairline Strong** ({tokens.color.hairline-strong}): Stronger 1px border for inputs
    
    ### Text
    - **Ink Deep** ({tokens.color.ink-deep}): Pure black for emphasis
    - **Ink** ({tokens.color.ink}): Primary headlines and body text
    - **Charcoal** ({tokens.color.charcoal}): Body emphasis (Notion's signature warm-charcoal)
    - **Slate** ({tokens.color.slate}): Secondary text
    - **Steel** ({tokens.color.steel}): Tertiary, footer links
    - **Stone** ({tokens.color.stone}): Muted labels
    - **Muted** ({tokens.color.muted}): Disabled, placeholders
    - **On Dark** ({tokens.color.on-dark}): White text on dark surfaces
    - **On Dark Muted** ({tokens.color.on-dark-muted}): Reduced-opacity white
    
    ### Semantic
    - **Success** ({tokens.color.semantic-success}): Confirmation green
    - **Warning** ({tokens.color.semantic-warning}): Mid-priority alerts (orange)
    - **Error** ({tokens.color.semantic-error}): Validation errors (red)
  typography: |
    ### Font Family
    **Notion Sans** (primary): Notion's custom Inter-based variable typeface. Fallbacks: Inter, -apple-system, system-ui, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, sans-serif. Humanist-geometric character used across every UI surface.
    
    ### Hierarchy
    
    | Token | Size | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Use |
    |---|---|---|---|---|---|
    | `{tokens.typography.hero-display}` | 80px | 600 | 1.05 | -2px | Hero ("Meet the night shift") |
    | `{tokens.typography.display-lg}` | 56px | 600 | 1.10 | -1px | Section openers |
    | `{tokens.typography.heading-1}` | 48px | 600 | 1.15 | -0.5px | Page-level headlines ("Try for free") |
    | `{tokens.typography.heading-2}` | 36px | 600 | 1.20 | -0.5px | Subsection headlines ("Keep work moving 24/7") |
    | `{tokens.typography.heading-3}` | 28px | 600 | 1.25 | 0 | Card titles |
    | `{tokens.typography.heading-4}` | 22px | 600 | 1.30 | 0 | Feature tile titles |
    | `{tokens.typography.heading-5}` | 18px | 600 | 1.40 | 0 | FAQ questions |
    | `{tokens.typography.subtitle}` | 18px | 400 | 1.50 | 0 | Hero subtitle |
    | `{tokens.typography.body-md}` | 16px | 400 | 1.55 | 0 | Primary body text |
    | `{tokens.typography.body-md-medium}` | 16px | 500 | 1.55 | 0 | Body emphasis |
    | `{tokens.typography.body-sm}` | 14px | 400 | 1.50 | 0 | Secondary body |
    | `{tokens.typography.body-sm-medium}` | 14px | 500 | 1.50 | 0 | Active sidebar, button labels |
    | `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}` | 13px | 600 | 1.40 | 0 | Badge labels |
    | `{tokens.typography.button-md}` | 14px | 500 | 1.30 | 0 | Button labels |
    
    ### Principles
    - Tight hero leading (1.05) on 80px display
    - Negative letter-spacing on display sizes (-2px to -0.5px)
    - Generous body leading (1.55) for documentation readability
    - 600 weight for headlines + 500 for buttons; 400 body
  layout: |
    ### Spacing System
    - **Base unit**: 4px (8px primary increment)
    - **Tokens**: `{tokens.spacing.xxs}` (4px) through `{tokens.spacing.hero}` (120px)
    - **Section rhythm**: Marketing pages use `{tokens.spacing.section-lg}` (96px); pricing tightens to `{tokens.spacing.section}` (64px)
    
    ### Grid & Container
    - 1280px max-width with 32px gutters
    - Pricing: 4-tier card row at desktop with dense comparison table
    - Homepage: centered hero with workspace mockup below buttons; alternating colorful feature card sections
    
    ### Whitespace Philosophy
    Marketing surfaces use generous breathing room between feature card bands. Workspace mockup card on hero gets full-width treatment with deep drop shadow.
  elevation: |
    | Level | Treatment | Use |
    |---|---|---|
    | 0 (flat) | No shadow; `{tokens.color.hairline}` border | Default cards, table rows |
    | 1 (subtle) | `rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.04) 0px 1px 2px 0px` | Hover-elevated tiles |
    | 2 (card) | `rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.08) 0px 4px 12px 0px` | Feature cards |
    | 3 (mockup) | `rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.20) 0px 24px 48px -8px` | Hero workspace mockup card |
    | 4 (modal) | `rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.16) 0px 16px 48px -8px` | Modals, dropdowns |
    
    ### Decorative Depth
    - Hero workspace mockup card uses deep diffuse drop shadow (Level 3) — significant elevation against the navy band
    - Pastel feature cards carry their own visual weight via tint backgrounds
    - Sticky-note dot illustrations and mesh wires add atmospheric decoration to navy hero
  shapes: |
    ### Border Radius Scale
    
    | Token | Value | Use |
    |---|---|---|
    | `{tokens.radius.xs}` | 4px | Tag chips |
    | `{tokens.radius.sm}` | 6px | Type badges |
    | `{tokens.radius.md}` | 8px | Buttons, inputs, search-pill |
    | `{tokens.radius.lg}` | 12px | Cards, pricing tiers, agent tiles, workspace mockup |
    | `{tokens.radius.xl}` | 16px | Larger feature panels |
    | `{tokens.radius.xxl}` | 20px | Featured product showcases |
    | `{tokens.radius.xxxl}` | 24px | Larger feature cards |
    | `{tokens.radius.full}` | 9999px | Status badges, pill tabs (NOT regular buttons) |
    
    Notion's geometry is sober-editorial — `{tokens.radius.md}` (8px) buttons distinguish it from pill-button-everywhere brands.
  components: |
    > Per the no-hover policy, hover states are NOT documented.
    
    ### Buttons
    
    **`button-primary`** — Signature purple rectangular primary CTA, the dominant action.
    - Background `{tokens.color.primary}`, text `{tokens.color.on-primary}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `10px 18px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`.
    - Pressed state `button-primary-pressed` deepens to `{tokens.color.primary-pressed}`.
    - Disabled state uses `{tokens.color.hairline}` background.
    
    **`button-dark`** — Black rectangular CTA on light backgrounds.
    - Background `{tokens.color.ink-deep}`, text `{tokens.color.on-dark}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `10px 18px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`.
    
    **`button-secondary`** — Outlined rectangular for secondary actions ("Request a demo").
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline-strong}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `10px 18px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`.
    
    **`button-on-dark`** — White button on dark hero bands.
    - Background `{tokens.color.on-dark}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `10px 18px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`.
    
    **`button-secondary-on-dark`** — Outlined button on dark.
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.on-dark}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.on-dark-muted}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `10px 18px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`.
    
    **`button-ghost`** — Quieter ghost button.
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, typography `{tokens.typography.button-md}`, padding `8px 12px`, rounded `{tokens.radius.sm}`.
    
    **`button-link`** — Inline blue text link (NOT primary purple).
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.link-blue}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-sm-medium}`, padding `0`.
    
    ### Cards & Containers
    
    **`card-base`** — Standard content card.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`card-feature`** — Feature card with larger padding.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`card-feature-yellow-bold`** — Bold yellow feature banner for high-emphasis content ("Ask your on-demand assistants").
    - Background `{tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}`, text `{tokens.color.charcoal}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`.
    
    **`card-feature-peach`** + **`card-feature-rose`** + **`card-feature-mint`** + **`card-feature-sky`** + **`card-feature-lavender`** + **`card-feature-yellow`** + **`card-feature-cream`** — Pastel-tinted feature cards.
    - Each variant uses its corresponding `card-tint-*` color as background, text `{tokens.color.charcoal}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`.
    
    **`card-agent-tile`** — Agent assistant tile.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`card-template`** — Template thumbnail card.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.lg}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`card-startup-perk`** — Startup-program perk grid item.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`pricing-card`** — Standard pricing tier card.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`pricing-card-featured`** — Featured pricing tier (Plus or Business — purple-bordered).
    - Background `{tokens.color.surface}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`, border `2px solid {tokens.color.primary}`.
    
    ### Inputs & Forms
    
    **`text-input`** — Standard text field.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline-strong}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.sm} {tokens.spacing.md}`, height 44px.
    
    **`text-input-focused`** — Activated state.
    - Border switches to `2px solid {tokens.color.primary}` (purple).
    
    **`search-pill`** — Search bar.
    - Background `{tokens.color.surface}`, text `{tokens.color.steel}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-md}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`, height 44px, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    ### Tabs
    
    **`pill-tab`** + **`pill-tab-active`** — Pill-style tab nav for top-level switching.
    - Inactive: text `{tokens.color.steel}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xs} {tokens.spacing.md}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.full}`.
    - Active: background `{tokens.color.ink-deep}`, text `{tokens.color.on-dark}`.
    
    **`segmented-tab`** + **`segmented-tab-active`** — Underline-style tab navigation.
    - Inactive: text `{tokens.color.steel}`, no border. Active: text `{tokens.color.ink}`, 2px bottom border in `{tokens.color.ink}`.
    
    ### Badges & Status
    
    **`badge-purple`** — Purple status badge (matches primary CTA).
    - Background `{tokens.color.primary}`, text `{tokens.color.on-primary}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.full}`, padding `4px 10px`.
    
    **`badge-pink`** — Pink accent badge.
    - Background `{tokens.color.brand-pink}`, text `{tokens.color.on-primary}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.full}`, padding `4px 10px`.
    
    **`badge-orange`** — Orange accent badge.
    - Background `{tokens.color.brand-orange}`, text `{tokens.color.on-primary}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.full}`, padding `4px 10px`.
    
    **`badge-tag-purple`** — Soft-purple feature tag chip.
    - Background `{tokens.color.card-tint-lavender}`, text `{tokens.color.brand-purple-800}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.sm}`, padding `2px 8px`.
    
    **`badge-tag-orange`** — Soft-orange feature tag.
    - Background `{tokens.color.card-tint-peach}`, text `{tokens.color.brand-orange-deep}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.sm}`, padding `2px 8px`.
    
    **`badge-tag-green`** — Soft-mint feature tag.
    - Background `{tokens.color.card-tint-mint}`, text `{tokens.color.brand-green}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.sm}`, padding `2px 8px`.
    
    **`badge-popular`** — "Most Popular" tier indicator.
    - Background `{tokens.color.primary}`, text `{tokens.color.on-primary}`, typography `{tokens.typography.caption-bold}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.full}`, padding `4px 10px`.
    
    **`promo-banner`** — Light surface promo strip ABOVE the top nav.
    - Background `{tokens.color.surface}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-sm-medium}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.sm} {tokens.spacing.md}`. ("Developers: Get a first look at our new Developer Platform on May 13.")
    
    ### Tables
    
    **`comparison-table`** — Pricing feature comparison table.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-sm}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`comparison-row`** — Individual feature row.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.md} {tokens.spacing.lg}`, bottom border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline-soft}`.
    
    ### Documentation Components
    
    **`workspace-mockup-card`** — Embedded Notion workspace UI mockup on hero band ("Ramp HQ" kanban board).
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`, deep shadow `rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.20) 0px 24px 48px -8px`. Carries actual Notion product UI mock.
    
    **`testimonial-card`** — Customer testimonial card.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxl}`, border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`logo-wall-item`** — Customer logo wordmark cell.
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.steel}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-md-medium}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.lg}`.
    
    **`faq-accordion-item`** — FAQ panel.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.md}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xl}`, bottom border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    
    **`stat-row`** — Stats strip with bar chart visualization ("More productivity. Fewer tools.").
    - Background `{tokens.color.surface}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.section-sm}`.
    
    **`cta-banner-light`** — Light surface CTA banner.
    - Background `{tokens.color.surface}`, text `{tokens.color.ink}`, rounded `{tokens.radius.lg}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.section}`.
    
    ### Navigation
    
    **Top Navigation (Marketing)** — Sticky white bar.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, height ~64px, bottom border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    - Left: Notion "N" logo + "Product / AI / Solutions / Resources / Enterprise / Pricing / Request a demo" links.
    - Right: "Get Notion free" purple button + "Log in" link.
    
    ### Signature Components
    
    **`hero-band-dark`** — Deep navy hero band with embedded workspace mockup and decorative dots/wires.
    - Background `{tokens.color.brand-navy}`, text `{tokens.color.on-dark}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.hero}`.
    - Layout: centered headline `{tokens.typography.hero-display}`, subtitle, button row (`button-primary` purple + `button-secondary-on-dark`), `workspace-mockup-card` below.
    - Atmospheric decoration: scattered colorful sticky-note dots and mesh wire illustrations around the hero content (NOT a literal pattern fill — handled per-page via SVG/illustration).
    
    **`footer-region`** — Multi-column light footer.
    - Background `{tokens.color.canvas}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.section} {tokens.spacing.xxl}`, top border `1px solid {tokens.color.hairline}`.
    - 6-column link grid (Product / Download / Resources / Notion for / Company / Legal).
    
    **`footer-link`** — Individual footer link.
    - Background transparent, text `{tokens.color.steel}`, typography `{tokens.typography.body-sm}`, padding `{tokens.spacing.xxs} 0`.
  responsive: |
    ### Breakpoints
    | Name | Width | Key Changes |
    |---|---|---|
    | Mobile (small) | < 480px | Single column. Hero 36px. Pricing 1-up. |
    | Mobile (large) | 480 – 767px | Feature cards 2-up. Hero 48px. |
    | Tablet | 768 – 1023px | 2-column feature grids. Hero 56px. |
    | Desktop | 1024 – 1279px | 4-tier pricing card row. Hero 72px. |
    | Wide Desktop | ≥ 1280px | Full 80px hero presentation. |
    
    ### Touch Targets
    - Buttons render at 40–44px effective height
    - Form inputs render at 44px height
    - Pill tabs ~32px → 44px on mobile
    
    ### Collapsing Strategy
    - **Promo banner** stays full-width; truncates at < 480px
    - **Top nav** below 1024px collapses to hamburger
    - **Hero band**: workspace mockup card moves below text/buttons on mobile
    - **Pricing tiers**: 4-column → 2-column tablet → 1-column mobile
    - **Feature cards**: 3-up desktop → 2-up tablet → 1-up mobile
    - **Hero typography**: 80px → 56px → 48px → 36px
    - **Footer**: 6-column desktop → 3-column tablet → accordion mobile
    
    ### Image Behavior
    - Workspace mockup card maintains aspect ratio
    - Pastel illustrations inside feature cards scale proportionally
    - Customer logo wall: wordmarks at consistent 60–80px height
  iteration: |
    1. Focus on ONE component at a time
    2. Reference component names and tokens directly
    3. Run `npx @google/design.md lint DESIGN.md` after edits
    4. Add new variants as separate `components:` entries
    5. Default to `{tokens.typography.body-md}` for body
    6. Keep `{tokens.color.primary}` (purple) as the primary CTA — distinct from `{tokens.color.link-blue}` for inline links
    7. Use `{tokens.radius.md}` for buttons (rectangles), `{tokens.radius.lg}` for cards, `{tokens.radius.full}` for pill tabs/badges only
  known_gaps: |
    - Specific dark-mode token values not surfaced beyond hero bands
    - Animation/transition timings not extracted; recommend 150–200ms ease
    - Form validation success state not explicitly captured
    - Pastel-tint mapping (which feature uses which tint) is observation-based — the actual brand library may have more entries
  dos:
    - "Use `{tokens.color.primary}` (purple) as the dominant CTA across all surfaces — it's the brand's recognizable signal"
    - "Pair deep navy hero bands ({tokens.color.brand-navy}) with the purple button + decorative sticky-note dots"
    - "Use pastel feature card tints (peach, rose, mint, lavender, sky, yellow) generously"
    - "Use `{tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}` for high-emphasis \"Ask the assistant\"-style banner cards"
    - "Apply `{tokens.radius.md}` (8px) to buttons consistently — Notion uses rectangles, not pills"
    - "Apply `{tokens.radius.lg}` (12px) to all card families"
    - Maintain Notion-Sans across every UI surface
    - Use the workspace mockup card on hero bands to show actual product UI
  donts:
    - use the purple for body text or large background surfaces
    - use pill-shaped buttons; Notion's geometry is rectangular-sober
    - "mix link-blue ({tokens.color.link-blue}) with primary-purple ({tokens.color.primary}) — they have distinct roles"
    - apply heavy shadows on flat documentation cards
    - replace Notion-Sans with a generic Inter

omitted:
  - section: tokens.elevation
    reason: "Depth model lives in rationale.elevation; add shadow tokens as they stabilize"

integrations:
  shadcn:
    enabled: true
    style: new-york            # legacy style; current styles: see SPEC §7.1
    icon_library: lucide
    css_variables: true
    base_color: neutral
    css: app/globals.css
    components_json: ./components.json
    aliases:
      components: "@/components"
      utils: "@/lib/utils"
      ui: "@/components/ui"
      lib: "@/lib"
      hooks: "@/hooks"
    radius: "8px"
    css_vars:
      theme:
        radius: "8px"
      light:
        background: "#ffffff"
        foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        card: "#f6f5f4"
        card-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        popover: "#f6f5f4"
        popover-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        primary: "#5645d4"
        primary-foreground: "#ffffff"
        secondary: "#f4f4f5"
        secondary-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        muted: "#bbb8b1"
        muted-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        accent: "#f4f4f5"
        accent-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        destructive: "#e03131"
        border: "#e5e3df"
        input: "#e5e3df"
        ring: "#5645d4"
        sidebar: "#ffffff"
        sidebar-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        sidebar-primary: "#5645d4"
        sidebar-primary-foreground: "#ffffff"
        sidebar-accent: "#f4f4f5"
        sidebar-accent-foreground: "#1a1a1a"
        sidebar-border: "#e5e3df"
        sidebar-ring: "#5645d4"
    map_from_tokens:
      background: tokens.color.canvas|tokens.color.surface|tokens.color.background
      foreground: tokens.color.ink|tokens.color.text|tokens.color.foreground
      primary: tokens.color.primary
      primary-foreground: tokens.color.on-primary
      border: tokens.color.hairline|tokens.color.border
      ring: tokens.color.primary-focus|tokens.color.primary

policy:
  if_missing: ask
  hierarchy: [typography, spacing, contrast, color]
  reuse:
    prefer_existing_components: true
  accessibility:
    contrast: AA
    focus_visible: required

constraints:
  always:
    - use semantic tokens from this file; never invent off-brand hex
    - bind every listed component property (backgroundColor, textColor, typography, rounded, padding, size, height, width)
    - read rationale.layout / rationale.elevation / rationale.shapes before inventing chrome
    - when shadcn is enabled, apply integrations.shadcn.css_vars to globals.css
    - prefer catalog components over one-off controls
    - "Use `{tokens.color.primary}` (purple) as the dominant CTA across all surfaces — it's the brand's recognizable signal"
    - "Pair deep navy hero bands ({tokens.color.brand-navy}) with the purple button + decorative sticky-note dots"
    - "Use pastel feature card tints (peach, rose, mint, lavender, sky, yellow) generously"
    - "Use `{tokens.color.card-tint-yellow-bold}` for high-emphasis \"Ask the assistant\"-style banner cards"
    - "Apply `{tokens.radius.md}` (8px) to buttons consistently — Notion uses rectangles, not pills"
    - "Apply `{tokens.radius.lg}` (12px) to all card families"
    - Maintain Notion-Sans across every UI surface
    - Use the workspace mockup card on hero bands to show actual product UI
  never:
    - generic purple-on-white AI chrome unrelated to this brand
    - dropping DESIGN.md component variants or rationale during restyle
    - use the purple for body text or large background surfaces
    - use pill-shaped buttons; Notion's geometry is rectangular-sober
    - "mix link-blue ({tokens.color.link-blue}) with primary-purple ({tokens.color.primary}) — they have distinct roles"
    - apply heavy shadows on flat documentation cards
    - replace Notion-Sans with a generic Inter

examples:
  good:
    - ref: https://notion.com
      note: Live brand marketing / product surfaces
    - ref: https://getdesign.md/notion/design-md
      note: Source DESIGN.md analysis

